# Shell Fundamentals To-Do App

This is a simple Bash To-Do application.

## Features

- View tasks
- Add tasks
- Delete tasks
- Exit program

## How to Run

```bash
chmod +x todo.sh
./todo.sh
Save with:

```text
ESC
:wq

